      {
       "text": "fcrepo-import-export",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Regarding: Import Export Tool (fcrepo-import-export.0.2.0.jar) ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Feature: Add a force overwrite option ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Discussion: At present, if an object has already been exported to a location, you cannot re-export the object to that location (this triggers an error). It would be useful to be able to force the overwrite of any existing resources with a -f flag. Could we have it?",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
